Package: cyclingpower
Type: Package
Title: Compare readings from multiple cycling power meters
Version: 0.2.0
Author: jz
Maintainer: jz <jameszuccollo@gmail.com>
Description: Read FIT and GPX ride files recorded by two or more power
    meters, align them onto a common clock, and quantify how their readings
    differ overall and across the power range. Supports linking a third
    meter to the first two through a bridge meter common to both rides.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
